        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana FLSP335, Solid Brass Full Lip Roller and Ball Catch Strike</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe full lip strike plate is for use with roller or ball catches. Can be used with <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-adjustable-roller-catch-deltana-rca336\"><b>Deltana RCA336 Roller Catch</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/heavy-duty-brass-roller-catch-deltana-rca430\"><b>Deltana RCA430 Roller Catch</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-ball-catch-with-round-corners-deltana-bc218r\"><b>Deltana BC218R Ball Catch</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-ball-catch-deltana-bc218\"><b>Deltana BC218 Ball Catch</b></a> or other other manufactures door catches. Packaged with matching finish mounting screws. Available in 7 different finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-FLSP335-size.gif?v=1704354683\" width=\"213\" height=\"142\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana FLSP335 Strike Plate Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nOther Roller Catch Strikes Also Available: \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-t-strike-for-roller-catch-deltana-tsrca275\"><b>Small Roller Catch T-Strike</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-ansi-strike-plate-for-roller-catch-deltana-tsrca4875\"><b>Large Roller Catch T-Strike</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana FLSP335 Strike Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Length: 1-5/8\" </li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FLSP335.pdf?v=1718159600\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana FLSP335 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass Full Lip Roller and Ball Catch Strike | Deltana FLSP335",
                "description": "Full Lip Roller Catch Strike Plate Deltana FLSP335 - The full lip strike plate is for use with roller or ball catches. Can be used with almost any door catch. It measures 2-1/4 inch wide and 1-5/8 inch high, Packaged with matching finish screws. Available in 7 different finishes. ",
